{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_11110190","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11110190","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1111018001:":{"text":"샅샅이 뒤져!","source_cn":"都给我仔细找","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C8C2C9C05F0E607","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1111018002:":{"text":"쓸 수 있는 건 전부 본진으로 가져간다!","source_cn":"还能用的东西全带回主营去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60253762F164EE65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1111018003:":{"text":"큭큭, 얘들아. 누가 온 것 같구나.","source_cn":"瞧瞧，弟兄们，有人来了","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F322A8214FF18AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1111018004:":{"text":"워커, 우리의 오랜 친구가 왔군...","source_cn":"瓦尔克，我们的老熟人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8407E7C217168C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111019001:1":{"text":"이게 누구야! 세일린워터 마을의 영웅이자, 사막의 발톱 보스를 죽인 현상금 사냥꾼, 워커 아닌가!","source_cn":"看看谁来了？咸水镇的大英雄，曾经刺杀流沙之爪首领的赏金...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE41679E8FE5E293","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111019002:1":{"text":"아, 미안. 깜빡했네. 그때 암살 작전은 실패로 돌아갔지? 프랭크한테서 간신히 목숨만 건져서 도망갔었잖아?","source_cn":"哦——对不起，我忘了，那次刺杀行动失败了，对吧？你从弗...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x407EEEBC986AB300","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1111019003:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1111019004:1":{"text":"그리고 네 파트너... 그래, 기억나. 와인이었나? 다이어트라고 했던가?","source_cn":"你的搭档。我还记得他。怀特？还是提亚特？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE125151B8492592","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1111019005:1":{"text":"워커와 다이어트, 인간과 트라이브... 참 기묘한 조합이긴 했어. 보수만 맞으면 모든 임무를 완벽히 수행했지...","source_cn":"奇怪的赏金猎人搭档，瓦尔克与提亚特，人类和蛮血，只要价...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7487CCE177FB6692","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1111019005":{"text":"워커와 다이어트, 인간과 트라이브... 참 기묘한 조합이긴 했어. 보수만 맞으면 모든 임무를 완벽히 수행했지...","source_cn":"奇怪的赏金猎人搭档，瓦尔克与提亚特，人类和蛮血，只要价格合适，没有完不成的任务……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7487CCE177FB6692","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1111019006:1":{"text":"와이어트야.","source_cn":"他叫怀亚特。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECBA0CAD6B278899","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1111019007:1":{"text":"아, 그래! 와이어트! 그게 새로운 이름이었지! 프랭크 두목이 사막에서 녀석을 한 방에 죽여버린 게 기억나. 장례는 제대로 치러줬나 모르겠네?","source_cn":"哦，对，怀亚特！那是他的新名字！我记得弗兰克头儿在沙漠...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA7AA3314F5C9958","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1111019008:1":{"text":"트라이브는 약자를 위해 눈물을 흘리지 않아. 너희 인간은 어떻지? 관을 보며 슬퍼하나?","source_cn":"蛮血不会为弱者哭泣，那你们人类呢？会对着棺材哀悼吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48B4824B569EF0BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1111019009:1":{"text":"닥쳐!","source_cn":"闭嘴。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB919F76B0D8C6BE3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1111019010:1":{"text":"하! 또 트라이브 애송이군.","source_cn":"哈！又一个蛮血小子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB47536EA9A96EDC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1111019011:1":{"text":"죽은 파트너의 복수를 도와달라고 워커가 사정이라도 하던가?","source_cn":"搭档死了，瓦尔克想找我们复仇，就找上你了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65C94EC48998C18A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1111019012:1":{"text":"난, 누구의, 파트너도 아니야. 그 사람이랑 같은 취급하지 마!","source_cn":"我、不是、任何人的搭档！别拿我和他混为一谈！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34A2AB13F4CBE244","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1111019013:1":{"text":"이봐, 트라이브 애송이. 아직 상황 파악이 안 되나? 네가 신뢰하는 그 파트너가 지금 널 사지로 내몰고 있다고.","source_cn":"蛮血小子，别不知好歹，你信任的同伴正在把你送上绝路呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96B236D928038967","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1111019014:1":{"text":"우리의 힘을 알기 때문에 너를 데리고 온 거야. 죽을까 봐 무섭지 않아?","source_cn":"他知道我们的厉害，所以才带着你来挑战我们，你就不怕陪他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA320DE712B3589A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1111019015:0":{"text":"워커의 과거 따위엔 관심 없어.","source_cn":"瓦尔克的过去，我管不着。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x245EC046662687F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1111019016:1":{"text":"다만 한 가진 확실하군. 네놈 때문에 내가 지금 굉장히 불쾌하다는 거야!","source_cn":"我只知道，你，让我很不爽！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89F3CE9032292FE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:0:1":{"text":"워커의 파트너가 트라이브였다고?","source_cn":"瓦尔克之前的搭档，是蛮血？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5FC1CD5F67E292AC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"워커의 파트너가 트라이브였다고?","female":"워커의 파트너가 트라이브였다고?","variant_male_record_index":"63894","variant_female_record_index":"63895","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:1:2":{"text":"비슷한 이름을 들은 적이 있는데...","source_cn":"之前听过类似的名字……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA2025BCC868C934E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"비슷한 이름을 들은 적이 있는데...","female":"비슷한 이름을 들은 적이 있는데...","variant_male_record_index":"63896","variant_female_record_index":"63897","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:2:3":{"text":"역시 총의 이름이 아닐 줄 알았어","source_cn":"我就猜到那不光是一把枪的名字","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE5412E9D214524DD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"역시 총의 이름이 아닐 줄 알았어","female":"역시 총의 이름이 아닐 줄 알았어","variant_male_record_index":"63898","variant_female_record_index":"63899","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:24:11010110:0":{"text":"상단을 약탈한 것은 역시 사막의 발톱이었고, 그들은 워커를 알고 있는 듯했다.","source_cn":"劫掠商队的果然是一群流沙之爪。他们似乎认识瓦尔克。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62A95DF8D06975BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:鬣心":{"text":"하트","source":"鬣心","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:瓦尔克":{"text":"워커","source":"瓦尔克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索恩":{"text":"소렌","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":30,"localized_text_count":25,"speaker_count":4}}